## dropped

dropped  figure, gcf, gca, gci, sca, sci, cla, clf, close, delaxes, fignum_exists, get_figlabels, get_fignums, get_current_fig_manager, new_figure_manager, findobj, get, getp, setp, get_plot_commands  matplotlib's state of current figures and axes, found and changed by name: a chart here is a value, laid out by `chart.lay_out`
dropped  show, draw, draw_if_interactive, ion, ioff, isinteractive, pause, ginput, waitforbuttonpress, connect, disconnect, subplot_tool, install_repl_displayhook, uninstall_repl_displayhook, switch_backend  a window and its events: a chart here is drawn once, as a picture
dropped  rc, rc_context, rcdefaults, set_loglevel, xkcd, box  global settings and styles: a chart's look is `chart.Look`, given with each chart
dropped  imread, imsave  image files: `image/png` and its neighbours read and write them
dropped  matplotlib.pyplot's classes and re-exported modules (Figure, Axes, Line2D, Text, cm, mlab, ...)  its object layer, which a program here does not reach: the records of the face hold a chart
